  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the notification for the post of Junior Engineer JE (Civil &amp; Electrical).&nbsp;This recruitment was released for 11 posts. Applications for the RBI Junior Engineer JE Recruitment 2026 were accepted from April 16, 2026, to May 06, 2026. The online examination is going to be conducted on 06 June 2026. Candidates who had qualified this pre examination can download their RBI Junior Engineer JE Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Reserve Bank of India (RBI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RBI JE Junior Engineer Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>16 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>06 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>06 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Exam Date : <strong>06 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>27 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC :<strong> Rs. 450/- (+GST Extra 18%)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PwBD, EXS :<strong> Rs. 50/- (+GST Extra 18%)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RBI JE Junior Engineer Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 April 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>20 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RBI JE Junior Engineer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RBI JE Junior Engineer 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts :11 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Engineer Civil</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">07</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Junior Engineer Electrical</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RBI JE Junior Engineer Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Engineer Civil</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have Passed Diploma in Civil Engineering with Minimum 65% Marks. For SC / ST : 55% Marks.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Engineering Degree Candidates : 55% Marks Required.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma Holder : 2 Year Working Experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Degree Holder : 1 Year Working Experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.764%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Engineer Electrical</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.236%;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Must Have Passed Diploma in Electrical Engineering with Minimum 65% Marks. For SC / ST : 55% Marks.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Engineering Degree Candidates : 55% Marks Required.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Diploma Holder : 2 Year Working Experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Degree Holder : 1 Year Working Experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RBI JE Junior Engineer Admit Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their RBI Junior Engineer JE Admit Card candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their RBI Junior Engineer JE Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their RBI Junior Engineer JE Admit Card.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also check their RBI Junior Engineer JE Admit Card from official site of the RBI.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RBI JE Junior Engineer Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Language Proficiency Test</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\