dmit Card has issued on 28 May 2026 by RBI.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. When will the RBI Junior Engineer JE exam be held?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> The RBI Junior Engineer JE examination is going to conducted on <strong>06 June 2026</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Q. Where can I check the RBI Junior Engineer JE Admit Card Admit Card 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official RBI website: rbi.org.in</p>\n<p><strong>Q. What should I search on the website to find the RBI Junior Engineer JE Admit Card Admit Card 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;Look for&nbsp;<strong>“Admit Card – RBI Assistant Recruitment 2026”</strong>&nbsp;in the notifications list</p>\n<p><strong>Q. What details are required to download the admit card?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Candidates need their&nbsp;<strong>Registration Number / Roll Number</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Password / Captcha</strong>&nbsp;to download the mains admit card</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is RBI Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of RBI is https://www.rbi.org.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
